# Dedicated checkout compiler cache; never store VM homes or evidence here.
.build-cache/

# Runtime evidence, private deliveries and VM disks stay outside Git. The
# historical evidence tree lives in the archive described in
# docs/operations/evidence-archive.md; a fixture a CI check reads goes under
# scripts/tests/fixtures/ after review. Never include credentials or raw captures.
/artifacts/
*.private
*.raw
*.seed
*.key
.env
.env.*

# Native CI device-guard output (handed off to the runner, never tracked).
/ci-output/
